# MOGO Automation Platform runtime state (MOGO-011 Step 1).
#
# The operational event log, the derived SQLite index, the task projection, the
# process lock and any quarantined fragment are written here. Runtime state is
# an observation of execution, not source code, and must never be committed as
# a side effect of a routine `git add` -- the same reasoning that governs
# `evidence/` (ADR-012 D-06).
#
# This file ignores everything in this directory except itself, which also keeps
# the directory present in a fresh clone so the runtime's default state root
# exists before first use.
*
!.gitignore
